# HitoriShaders - HITORI - option labels (English)
profile.LOW=Low
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.HIGH=High
profile.ULTRA=Ultra
profile.comment=Quality preset. Medium is tuned for 60 fps on a mid-range GPU at 1080p. Low drops the reflections, the lamp shadows, the volumetric mist and the beam shadows; High and Ultra trace finer reflections and smoother mist.

screen.LIGHTS=Lamps
screen.LIGHTS.comment=The restaurant's light sources: every lamp lights in its own colour (exit signs, fluorescent tubes, sodium lamps ...).
screen.REFLECT=Reflections & Wet
screen.REFLECT.comment=The wet lot after the rain, the puddles, the glossy floors, the windows and the mirrors.
screen.SPIRITS=Spirits
screen.SPIRITS.comment=What the spirits leave in the picture.
screen.FLASHLIGHT=Flashlight
screen.FLASHLIGHT.comment=The beam of the flashlight.
screen.ATMOSPHERE=Mist & Air
screen.ATMOSPHERE.comment=The low mist over the wet lot, the dust indoors, the lamps glowing in the air.
screen.FEAR=Fear
screen.FEAR.comment=What your heart rate and the nearness of danger do to the picture.
screen.POST=Image
screen.POST.comment=Film grain, vignette, chromatic aberration and bloom.
screen.SUN=Sun & Shadow
screen.SUN.comment=Sun and moon shadows outside the restaurant's world (its sky is overcast).

option.FLASH_REDUCTION=Flash Reduction
option.FLASH_REDUCTION.comment=For photosensitive players: calmer flicker of broken tubes, signs and the flashlight, no heartbeat-pulsing vignette, no breathing image, no focus hunting in the finder.
option.BRIGHTNESS=Brightness
option.BRIGHTNESS.comment=Overall brightness. Raise it if you cannot see anything (the horror gets a little weaker).

option.COLORED_LIGHT=Coloured Lamps
option.COLORED_LIGHT.comment=Every lamp lights its surroundings in its own colour, with its own flicker and highlights on glossy surfaces. Off: one warm block light.
option.LIGHT_STRENGTH=Lamp Brightness
option.LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly the restaurant's lamps light the world.
option.LIGHT_SHADOWS=Lamp Shadows
option.LIGHT_SHADOWS.comment=Tables, chairs and planters throw shadows from the nearest lamp (screen space): deep darkness under the tables.
option.LIGHT_FLICKER=Lamp Flicker
option.LIGHT_FLICKER.comment=Broken tubes stutter, the old sign buzzes, the traffic light blinks, a dying street lamp fades out.

option.REFLECTIONS=Reflections
option.REFLECTIONS.comment=Screen-space reflections: the sign and the lamps mirrored in the wet lot and the puddles, the lights on the glossy floors, the windows, the mirrors.
option.SSR_STEPS=Reflection Quality
option.SSR_STEPS.comment=Steps per reflected ray. More reaches further and misses less, but is slower.
option.WET_SURFACES=Wet After the Rain
option.WET_SURFACES.comment=Everything under the open sky is wet: darker, glossy, with standing water in the dips and drips making rings.
option.GLASS_DROPLETS=Rain on the Windows
option.GLASS_DROPLETS.comment=Drops and run-down streaks left on the shop windows; they catch the light and bend what is behind them.

option.SPIRIT_HAZE=Spirit Haze
option.SPIRIT_HAZE.comment=Where a spirit stands the air wavers and colours split - even when your eyes cannot see it.
option.AFTERIMAGE=Finder Afterimage
option.AFTERIMAGE.comment=In the camera's finder the glowing spirits leave a short afterimage when they move.

option.BEAM_STRENGTH=Beam Brightness
option.BEAM_STRENGTH.comment=How brightly the flashlight lights the world.
option.BEAM_FOG=Visible Beam
option.BEAM_FOG.comment=How strongly the beam glows in the mist and dust. 0 turns the visible cone off.
option.BEAM_SAMPLES=Beam Quality
option.BEAM_SAMPLES.comment=Samples per pixel for the visible beam. More is smoother but slower.
option.BEAM_SHADOWS=Beam Shadows
option.BEAM_SHADOWS.comment=Things throw thin shadows in the flashlight beam and under the camera flash (screen space).
option.LENS_COOKIE=Reflector Rings
option.LENS_COOKIE.comment=The faint rings and smudges a real flashlight reflector and lens put into the beam.
option.DUST_MOTES=Dust in the Beam
option.DUST_MOTES.comment=Specks of dust (and fine droplets outside) floating in the beam.

option.FOG_DENSITY=Mist Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=How thick the mist and the dust are. Lower it to see further.
option.FOG_NOISE=Drifting Mist
option.FOG_NOISE.comment=The mist is uneven and creeps across the lot in slow wisps. Off: smooth (faster).
option.VOLUMETRIC_FOG=Volumetric Mist
option.VOLUMETRIC_FOG.comment=The mist is marched through: the street lamps, the sign and the exit signs glow in it. Off: a cheaper estimate.
option.VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES=Mist Quality
option.VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES.comment=Samples per pixel for the mist. More is smoother but slower.

option.FEAR_EFFECTS=Fear Effects
option.FEAR_EFFECTS.comment=Strength of the heartbeat vignette, tunnel vision, colour fringes, breathing image and double vision.
option.PAREIDOLIA=Faces in the Dark
option.PAREIDOLIA.comment=At very high fear, something like faces seems to form in the darkness at the edge of your vision.

option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Shadows cast by the sun and the moon (outside the restaurant's overcast world).
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Higher gives finer sun shadows but is slower. (The restaurant's world uses its own small light map.)
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far the sun shadows reach.
option.SHADOW_FILTER=Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Number of samples that soften the shadow edges.
value.SHADOW_FILTER.1=Low (4)
value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=Medium (8)
value.SHADOW_FILTER.3=High (12)
option.WAVING_PLANTS=Swaying Plants
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment=The hedges and the flowers stir very slightly in the still air after the rain.

option.FILM_GRAIN=Film Grain
option.FILM_GRAIN.comment=Grain noise. Stronger with fear and danger, heavy in the camera's finder.
option.VIGNETTE=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE.comment=Darkens the corners. It closes in with fear and beats with your heart; deep in the finder.
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION=Chromatic Aberration
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION.comment=Colour fringes at the edges. Stronger at high fear, in danger and through the finder.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Soft glow round the lamps, the signs, the embers; halation in the finder.
